Description: c3270: hide menu items whose actions are suppressed
 The suppressActions resource keeps actions from running, but the c3270
 menus still offered the items that run them: chosen, they did nothing.
 Leave the File menu items out whose actions are suppressed (for example
 Disconnect and Quit), the Options menu if Toggle is suppressed and the
 Keypad menu if Keypad is suppressed. action_suppressed() becomes public for
 that, and renaming or enabling an item that is not in the menu is a no-op.
Author: Yvan Janssens <yvanj@cyber.gent>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-19
